    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis beautifully presented, modern three-bedroom family home boasts a highly sought-after A BER rating, offering excellent energy efficiency. \n\nPerfectly positioned overlooking a beautifully maintained green space and children's play area, the property is within walking distance of everything Rush has to offer, including stunning beaches, cafés, schools, shops and a host of local amenities.\n\nThe bright and stylish accommodation is designed for modern family living and comprises a welcoming entrance hall, guest W.C. with utility space, a spacious living room with plantation shutters, and double doors opening to an open-plan kitchen/dining area with access to the rear garden.\n\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, together with a family bathroom. \n\nOutside, there is private driveway parking to the front and a low-maintenance rear garden laid in lawn with a garden shed, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining, play and relaxation.\n\nThis property is just a short stroll from the breathtaking North Beach, Rush village, and a host of local amenities including shopping, cafes, theatre, beaches, sports facilities to name but a few. \n\nRush is conveniently located for access to the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport being only a 10-15-minute drive away. Public transport is well catered for with the commuter trains from Rush and Lusk station giving direct access to Dublin city centre, as well as Dublin bus services."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.57m x 5.48m\nWith wooden flooring and understairs storage.\n\nGuest W.C. - 1.41m x 2.13m\nWith tiled flooring, W.C., W.H.B., plumbed for washing machine and room for tumble dryer.\n\nLiving Room - 3.86m x 3.94m\nWith wooden flooring, double doors leading to kitchen/dining area.\n\nDining Area - 3.19m x 5.10m\nOpen plan area with kitchen with wooden flooring throughout, double patio doors to rear garden.\n\nKitchen - 2.67m x 2.91m\nFully fitted modern kitchen with floor and wall mounted units, integrated fridge freezer, oven, hob & extractor fan and dishwasher, stainless steel splash back and breakfast bar.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 1.72m x 2.79m\nWith carpet flooring, hot press.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.08m x 3.16m\nSpacious double room with carpet flooring, generous walk-in wardrobe and door to ensuite.\n\nWalk In Wardrobe - 1.82m x 1.74m\nWith carpet flooring, built in storage and shelving\n\nEn-Suite - 1.67m x 1.78m\nWith tiled flooring, W.C., & W.H.B., and tiled shower cubicle with dual shower heads.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.99m x 4.54m\nWith carpet flooring, plantation shutters to windows and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.77m x 3.33m\nWith carpet flooring and plantation shutters to window.\n\nBathroom - 1.67m x 2.27m\nWith tiled floors and part tiled walls, bath with shower, W.C., & W.H.B.\n\nOutside - \nThe front of the property features mature border planting, private driveway parking for two vehicles and a gated side entrance leading to the rear garden.The enclosed rear garden is very private, beautifully maintained and thoughtfully landscaped, offering a combination of two paved patio areas, a lawn and mature border planting, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing in a peaceful setting.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Excellent property in turnkey condition. </li><li>A Rated energy efficient home. </li><li>Partially floored attic. </li><li>Overlooking green space with play area. </li><li>Close to all local amenities.</li><li>Bus stop at entrance to the estate.</li><li>Private driveway parking for two cars.</li><li>Side entrance to good sized rear garden.</li><li>Creche in the estate.</ul>"
      },
